    cml:operator "Overlaps" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Monitoring and compliance systems must be implemented at the same time as the undertaking" ;
    cml:premiseText "(5) The ACCC must not accept an undertaking under this section unless the ACCC is satisfied that:  (a) the undertaking provides for:  (i) the ACCC to monitor Telstra’s compliance with the undertaking; and  (ii) Telstra to have systems, procedures and processes that promote and facilitate the ACCC’s monitoring of Telstra’s compliance with the undertaking; and  (b) the undertaking does so in an appropriate and effective manner." ;
