concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577ab cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577ab-logic-deontic-5 .
